db_ptr←openExt(db_str cfg);st;err
⍝ Open database with configuration
⍝ db_str: database name (with path) or :memory:
⍝ cfg: configuration pointer (from config function) or 0 for default
⍝ db_ptr: pointer to database or 0 on error

:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init
:EndIf

(st db_ptr err)←api.duckdb_open_ext db_str 0 cfg 0

:If st≠0
    :If err≠0
        ⎕←'Database open error: ',256 read.utf8 err
        {}api.duckdb_free err
    :EndIf
    db_ptr←0
:EndIf

